      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Summarizing it may be concluded that Nitromint spray is an effective drug, it is well tolerated and it has no unexpected side-effects. Comparing the spray to Nitromint tablet its action develops more rapidly but the duration of action does not differ significantly from that of the tablet. The incidence of side-effects is nearly identical with both products. The majority of patients found Nitromint spray to be more effective and preferred its use to that of the tablet."},
